@startuml RandomProviderNetworkReveal
!include ../style.puml

title Random Provider Network - REVEAL PHASE

package "Provider Network" {
    component "Provider A (Lead)" as ProviderA <<RandomProvider>>
    component "Provider B" as ProviderB <<RandomProvider>>
    component "Provider C" as ProviderC <<RandomProvider>>
}

package "Whisper Network" {
    component "Whisper Network" as WhisperNet
}

package "Blockchain" {
    component "Contract Instance" as ContractInstance <<IRandomContract>>
}

' REVEAL PHASE - Whisper Network Socialization
ProviderA -[#4682B4]-> WhisperNet : broadcast reveals
ProviderB -[#4682B4]-> WhisperNet : broadcast reveals
ProviderC -[#4682B4]-> WhisperNet : broadcast reveals

WhisperNet .[#4682B4].> ProviderA : **1. Receive all reveals**
WhisperNet .[#4682B4].> ProviderB : receive all reveals
WhisperNet .[#4682B4].> ProviderC : receive all reveals

' REVEAL PHASE - Single Provider Posts All (Lead Provider)
ProviderA -[#4682B4]-> ContractInstance : **2. reveal(allRevealParams)**\nBATCH POST all reveals

' Final entropy generation
ContractInstance -[#228B22]-> ContractInstance : **3. Generate Entropy**\nfinal randomness

note right of WhisperNet
  **WHISPER SOCIALIZATION**
  
  1. Each provider broadcasts reveals
  2. All providers receive all reveals
  3. Lead provider validates ALL reveals
  4. Only lead provider posts to chain
end note

note bottom of ContractInstance
  **BATCH REVEAL**
  
  Single transaction contains
  reveals from ALL providers.
  Contract validates and generates
  final entropy efficiently.
end note

note left of ProviderA
  **Lead Provider**
  
  Validates all reveals match
  commitments, then posts
  batch reveal transaction
end note

@enduml